  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that config_001 (RNA-only with PCA encoding) achieves moderate performance, but the impact of RNA encoder choices (e.g., PCA vs. scvi_n200) and aggregation methods remains unclear. This experiment tests the effect of switching the RNA encoder to scvi_n200 while keeping profile setting and aggregation unchanged (singleprofile, no aggregation). It isolates the impact of the RNA encoder, a critical design choice, and directly compares performance against the baseline. This reduces uncertainty about encoder effectiveness without introducing other variables, aligning with the principle of balancing exploration and exploitation."
